" y=\"618\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Obesity is not a caloric disorder.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">It is a HORMONAL disorder.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"688\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Insulin sits at the center of the system</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"760\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">If the standard advice worked,</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">we would not be in this crisis.</text>\n                </svg>",
