     "type": "concept",
     "title": "The Calories-In, Calories-Out (CICO) Model",
     "content": "For nearly a century, mainstream medicine has explained obesity with a single equation:\n\n**Body Fat = Calories In − Calories Out**\n\nIn this view, weight gain is a problem of **arithmetic**. Eat 500 extra calories a day, gain a pound a week. Burn 500 extra, lose a pound a week.\n\nThe CICO model relies on three big assumptions:\n• **Calories In and Calories Out are independent** — eating less doesn't affect how much you burn\n• **Basal metabolic rate is stable** — your body burns roughly the same baseline regardless of intake\n• **Willpower controls intake** — hunger is a choice, and disciplined people make better choices\n\nFung's argument is that **all three assumptions are false**. Reduce calories and the body responds by **lowering metabolic rate**, **increasing hunger hormones**, and **conserving fat**. The equation is not a math problem — it is a **homeostatic system** with feedback loops.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE CICO MODEL</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Calories In minus Calories Out</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"170\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE EQUATION</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Body Fat = Calories In - Calories Out</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"330\" width=\"290\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"225\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASSUMPTION 1</text>\n                    <text x=\"225\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">In and Out are</text>\n                    <text x=\"225\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">independent</text>\n                    <text x=\"225\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Eating less does not</text>\n                    <text x=\"225\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">change burn rate</text>\n                    <rect x=\"405\" y=\"330\" width=\"290\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASSUMPTION 2</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Metabolic rate</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">stays stable</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Baseline burn does</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">not adapt to diet</text>\n                    <rect x=\"730\" y=\"330\" width=\"290\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"875\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASSUMPTION 3</text>\n                    <text x=\"875\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Willpower controls</text>\n                    <text x=\"875\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">intake</text>\n                    <text x=\"875\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Hunger is just a</text>\n                    <text x=\"875\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">conscious choice</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"600\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FUNG'S COUNTER-CLAIM</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">All three assumptions are wrong.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"725\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The body adapts — calories in and out are coupled</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "The standard model and its hidden assumptions"
     }
