"22\">Condiments and sauces</text>\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"482\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Ketchup, BBQ, dressings often loaded</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"515\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">4.</text>\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">'Low-fat' products</text>\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"597\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Sugar replaces missing fat for flavor</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"630\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">5.</text>\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Post-dinner sweets — worst timing</text>\n                    <text x=\"210\" y=\"712\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Storage maximized during sleep</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"780\" width=\"700\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Pick ONE category.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Eliminate it for 7 days.</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Measure how you feel.</text>\n                </svg>",
