      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">FASTING MYTHS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Most are cultural inertia, not science</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"170\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'BREAKFAST IS MOST IMPORTANT'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Origin: 1944 cereal marketing campaign</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"285\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'FASTING = STARVATION MODE'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"363\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Adaptation takes 3-4 weeks, not hours</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"400\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'FASTING BURNS MUSCLE'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"478\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">GH rises 2-5x specifically to spare muscle</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"515\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'FASTING SLOWS METABOLISM'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"593\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Studies show stable or slightly elevated</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"630\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"675\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'EAT EVERY 2-3 HOURS'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"708\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">True only for insulin-dependent diabetes</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"745\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">'YOU'LL OVEREAT AFTER'</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"823\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Most people don't fully compensate</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"870\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"903\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Most fasting fears are myths, not science</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Common fears about fasting — most are not supported"
