     "explanation": "This is the **core thesis** of *The Obesity Code* and this seminar: obesity is fundamentally a **hormonal**, not caloric, disorder. The primary driver is **chronic insulin elevation** from modern diet (refined carbs/sugar) and modern eating patterns (constant snacking, no fasted state). The solution requires both **composition changes** (lesson 6) AND **meal timing changes** (lesson 7), supported by **lifestyle factors** like sleep and stress (lesson 5). This framework explains why CICO diets fail, why sugar is uniquely toxic, why fasting works, and why metabolic disease is reversible — but only by addressing the **upstream hormonal cause**.",
