      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Depth of Metabolic Shift</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"180\" width=\"800\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" opacity=\"0.3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">16:8 daily window ends ~ here</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"300\" width=\"550\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" opacity=\"0.3\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24-hour fast reaches ketosis</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"420\" width=\"300\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#ef4444\" opacity=\"0.3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"465\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ADF cycles deepest</text><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"540\" x2=\"950\" y2=\"540\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#888\">short</text><text x=\"850\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#888\">long</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Same category, different physiological depth</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"215\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"335\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"455\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/></svg>",
      "caption": "Longer or less frequent fasting protocols push metabolism further along the same physiological timeline than daily time-restricted eating."
